# Davr va filtr andozasi

## CSS tokenlar (`html`)

- `--filter-ctrl-h: 2.5rem` (40px)
- `--filter-ctrl-radius: 0.75rem`
- `--filter-ctrl-fs: 0.875rem`

Mahsulot select, Dan/Gacha, qidiruv, pill — **bir xil balandlik**. Past/baland farq bo‘lmasin.

## UI

```
Mahsulot turi
[ Barcha mahsulotlar ▾ ]   DAN [ dd.mm.yyyy | 📅 ]   GACHA [ dd.mm.yyyy | 📅 ]
```

- Wrapper: `thub-date` / `rhub-date`
- `DatePicker` `variant="compact"` + `placeholder="dd.mm.yyyy"`
- Oraliq: `OrderPeriodPicker` (bo‘sh = barcha)

## Manba

`OrderPeriodPicker.tsx`, `DatePicker.tsx`, `.thub-date` / `.filter-select` / `.marketing-product-filter`
